    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="核心api和宏"><a href="#核心api和宏" class="headerlink" title="核心api和宏"></a>核心api和宏</h2><h3 id="注册相关"><a href="#注册相关" class="headerlink" title="注册相关"></a>注册相关</h3><p>1 MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE<br>2 module_i2c_driver()</p><h3 id="i2c相关"><a href="#i2c相关" class="headerlink" title="i2c相关"></a>i2c相关</h3><p>1 i2c_set_clientdata()<br>2 i2c_get_clientdata()<br>3 i2c_smbus_read_i2c_block_data()<br>4 i2c_smbus_write_byte_data()<br>5 i2c_check_functionality()</p><h3 id="misc相关"><a href="#misc相关" class="headerlink" title="misc相关"></a>misc相关</h3><p>1 misc_register()<br>2 misc_deregister()</p><h3 id="打印相关"><a href="#打印相关" class="headerlink" title="打印相关"></a>打印相关</h3><p>1 dev_info()<br>2 dev_err()<br>3 scnprintf()</p><h3 id="空间缓冲相关"><a href="#空间缓冲相关" class="headerlink" title="空间缓冲相关"></a>空间缓冲相关</h3><p>1 devm_kzalloc()<br>2 simple_read_from_buffer()</p><h3 id="工具类相关"><a href="#工具类相关" class="headerlink" title="工具类相关"></a>工具类相关</h3><p>1 container_of()</p>]]></content>
    
    
