    <title>IMX6ULL-项目开发 Day 1</title>
    <link href="/2026/05/09/IMX6ULL-%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91-Day-1/"/>
    <url>/2026/05/09/IMX6ULL-%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91-Day-1/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="一、i2c篇-MPU6050和AP3216C外设驱动"><a href="#一、i2c篇-MPU6050和AP3216C外设驱动" class="headerlink" title="一、i2c篇 MPU6050和AP3216C外设驱动"></a>一、i2c篇 MPU6050和AP3216C外设驱动</h2><h3 id="1-根据硬件原理图确认硬件相关信息"><a href="#1-根据硬件原理图确认硬件相关信息" class="headerlink" title="1.根据硬件原理图确认硬件相关信息"></a>1.根据硬件原理图确认硬件相关信息</h3><p>外设挂在哪一条I2C总线上? 设备的7-bit I2C地址是多少? 物理引脚是什么，引脚复用怎么设置?</p><blockquote><p>MPU6050:<br>  总线：I2C1<br>  地址：0x68(0xD0 &gt;&gt; 1)<br>  功能：三轴加速度 + 三轴陀螺仪 + 温度<br>  引脚复用配置：MX6UL_PAD_UART4_RX_DATA__I2C1_SDA MX6UL_PAD_UART4_TX_DATA__I2C1_SCL</p></blockquote><blockquote><p>AP3216C：<br>  总线：I2C1<br>  地址：0x1e<br>  功能：环境光 ALS + 接近 PS + 红外 IR</p></blockquote><h3 id="2-修改设备树"><a href="#2-修改设备树" class="headerlink" title="2.修改设备树"></a>2.修改设备树</h3><p>(a) 配置pinctrl子系统，在iomuxc节点下增加新的引脚组。<br>(b) 在i2c1控制器下增加两个新的节点。</p><figure class="highlight dts"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs dts"><span class="hljs-variable">&amp;iomuxc</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">&#123;</span><br><span class="hljs-symbol">    pinctrl_i2c1:</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">i2c1grp</span> <span class="hljs-punctuation">&#123;</span><br>        <span class="hljs-attr">fsl,pins</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-params">&lt;</span><br><span class="hljs-params">            MX6UL_PAD_UART4_TX_DATA__I2C1_SCL  <span class="hljs-number">0x4001b8b0</span></span><br><span class="hljs-params">            MX6UL_PAD_UART4_RX_DATA__I2C1_SDA  <span class="hljs-number">0x4001b8b0</span></span><br><span class="hljs-params">        &gt;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">;</span><br> <span class="hljs-punctuation">&#125;;</span><br><span class="hljs-punctuation">&#125;</span><br><span class="hljs-variable">&amp;i2c1</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">&#123;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">clock-frequency</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-params">&lt;<span class="hljs-number">100000</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">pinctrl-names</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;default&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">;</span><br>    pinctrl<span class="hljs-number">-0</span> = <span class="hljs-params">&lt;<span class="hljs-variable">&amp;pinctrl_i2c1</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">status</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;okay&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">;</span><br><br>    <span class="hljs-title class_">mpu6050@68</span> <span class="hljs-punctuation">&#123;</span><br>        <span class="hljs-attr">compatible</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;rickyduran,i2c_mpu6050&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">;</span><br>        <span class="hljs-attr">reg</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-params">&lt;<span class="hljs-number">0x68</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">;</span><br>        <span class="hljs-attr">status</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;okay&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-punctuation">&#125;;</span><br><br>    <span class="hljs-title class_">ap3216c@1e</span> <span class="hljs-punctuation">&#123;</span><br>        <span class="hljs-attr">compatible</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;rickyduran,i2c_ap3216c&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">;</span><br>        <span class="hljs-attr">reg</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-params">&lt;<span class="hljs-number">0x1e</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">;</span><br>        <span class="hljs-attr">status</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;okay&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-punctuation">&#125;;</span><br><span class="hljs-punctuation">&#125;;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="3-编写I2C驱动框架-以AP3216C为例"><a href="#3-编写I2C驱动框架-以AP3216C为例" class="headerlink" title="3.编写I2C驱动框架(以AP3216C为例)"></a>3.编写I2C驱动框架(以AP3216C为例)</h3><p><strong>根据设备树匹配的方式配对设备和驱动</strong>: 注意驱动的compatible字段一定和设备树中的compatible属性值一致，将来设备树加载后节点会被内核解析并构建device，一致才能保证device和driver正确匹配从而正确调用probe函数。</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">static</span> <span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">of_device_id</span> <span class="hljs-title">ap3216c_of_match</span>[] =</span> &#123;<br>    &#123; .compatible = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;rickyduran,i2c_ap3216c&quot;</span> &#125;,<br>    &#123; &#125;<br>&#125;;<br>MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(of, ap3216c_of_match);<br><br><span class="hljs-type">static</span> <span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">i2c_device_id</span> <span class="hljs-title">ap3216c_id</span>[] =</span> &#123;<br>    &#123; <span class="hljs-string">&quot;ap3216c_raw&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0</span> &#125;,<br>    &#123; &#125;<br>&#125;;<br>MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(i2c, ap3216c_id);<br><br><span class="hljs-type">static</span> <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">i2c_driver</span> <span class="hljs-title">ap3216c_driver</span> =</span> &#123;<br>    .driver = &#123;<br>        .name = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;ap3216c_raw&quot;</span>,<br>        .of_match_table = ap3216c_of_match,<br>    &#125;,<br>    .probe    = ap3216c_probe,<br>    .remove   = ap3216c_remove,<br>    .id_table = ap3216c_id,<br>&#125;;<br>module_i2c_driver(ap3216c_driver);<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="4-在probe函数中完成初始化注册-dev节点"><a href="#4-在probe函数中完成初始化注册-dev节点" class="headerlink" title="4.在probe函数中完成初始化注册&#x2F;dev节点"></a>4.在probe函数中完成初始化注册&#x2F;dev节点</h3><p>设备和驱动配对成功后调用probe函数，在probe函数中完成相关初始化操作并注册misc字符设备。<br>在remove函数中注销misc字符设备。</p><blockquote><p>AP3216C 芯片初始化相关操作</p></blockquote><ol><li>写 0x04 到系统配置寄存器(0x00)，复位芯片</li><li>延时</li><li>写 0x03 到系统配置寄存器(0x00)，使能开启 ALS + PS + IR</li></ol><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br><span class="line">54</span><br><span class="line">55</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs C"><span class="hljs-type">static</span> <span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">ap3216c_probe</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> i2c_client *client, <span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> i2c_device_id *id)</span><br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">ap3216c_dev</span> *<span class="hljs-title">dev</span>;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> ret;<br><br>    dev_info(&amp;client-&gt;dev, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;ap3216c probe, addr=0x%02x\n&quot;</span>, client-&gt;addr);<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (!i2c_check_functionality(client-&gt;adapter,<br>                                I2C_FUNC_I2C |<br>                                I2C_FUNC_SMBUS_BYTE_DATA |<br>                                I2C_FUNC_SMBUS_I2C_BLOCK)) &#123;<br>        dev_err(&amp;client-&gt;dev, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;i2c functionality not supported\n&quot;</span>);<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> -ENODEV;<br>    &#125;<br><br>    ret = ap3216c_hw_init(client);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (ret) &#123;<br>        dev_err(&amp;client-&gt;dev, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;hardware init failed: %d\n&quot;</span>, ret);<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> ret;<br>    &#125;<br><br>    dev = devm_kzalloc(&amp;client-&gt;dev, <span class="hljs-keyword">sizeof</span>(*dev), GFP_KERNEL);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (!dev)<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> -ENOMEM;<br><br>    dev-&gt;client = client;<br>    mutex_init(&amp;dev-&gt;lock);<br><br>    dev-&gt;miscdev.minor = MISC_DYNAMIC_MINOR;<br>    dev-&gt;miscdev.name  = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;ap3216c_raw&quot;</span>;<br>    dev-&gt;miscdev.fops  = &amp;ap3216c_fops;<br>    dev-&gt;miscdev.parent = &amp;client-&gt;dev;<br><br>    i2c_set_clientdata(client, dev);<br><br>    ret = misc_register(&amp;dev-&gt;miscdev);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (ret) &#123;<br>        dev_err(&amp;client-&gt;dev, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;misc register failed: %d\n&quot;</span>, ret);<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> ret;<br>    &#125;<br><br>    dev_info(&amp;client-&gt;dev, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;/dev/ap3216c_raw created\n&quot;</span>);<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-type">static</span> <span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">ap3216c_remove</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> i2c_client *client)</span><br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">ap3216c_dev</span> *<span class="hljs-title">dev</span> =</span> i2c_get_clientdata(client);<br><br>    misc_deregister(&amp;dev-&gt;miscdev);<br>    dev_info(&amp;client-&gt;dev, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;ap3216c removed\n&quot;</span>);<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;  <br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><p>MPU6050 芯片初始化相关操作</p></blockquote><ol><li>读取 WHO_AM_I，确认芯片响应</li><li>写 PWR_MGMT_1，唤醒芯片</li><li>配置采样率、低通滤波、陀螺仪量程、加速度量程</li></ol><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">static</span> <span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">mpu6050_probe</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> i2c_client *client,</span><br><span class="hljs-params">                         <span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> i2c_device_id *id)</span><br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">mpu6050_dev</span> *<span class="hljs-title">dev</span>;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> ret;<br><br>    dev_info(&amp;client-&gt;dev, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;mpu6050 probe, addr=0x%02x\n&quot;</span>, client-&gt;addr);<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (!i2c_check_functionality(client-&gt;adapter,<br>                                 I2C_FUNC_I2C |<br>                                 I2C_FUNC_SMBUS_BYTE_DATA |<br>                                 I2C_FUNC_SMBUS_I2C_BLOCK)) &#123;<br>        dev_err(&amp;client-&gt;dev, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;i2c functionality not supported\n&quot;</span>);<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> -ENODEV;<br>    &#125;<br><br>    ret = mpu6050_hw_init(client);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (ret) &#123;<br>        dev_err(&amp;client-&gt;dev, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;hardware init failed: %d\n&quot;</span>, ret);<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> ret;<br>    &#125;<br><br>    dev = devm_kzalloc(&amp;client-&gt;dev, <span class="hljs-keyword">sizeof</span>(*dev), GFP_KERNEL);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (!dev)<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> -ENOMEM;<br><br>    dev-&gt;client = client;<br>    mutex_init(&amp;dev-&gt;lock);<br><br>    dev-&gt;miscdev.minor = MISC_DYNAMIC_MINOR;<br>    dev-&gt;miscdev.name  = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;mpu6050_raw&quot;</span>;<br>    dev-&gt;miscdev.fops  = &amp;mpu6050_fops;<br>    dev-&gt;miscdev.parent = &amp;client-&gt;dev;<br><br>    i2c_set_clientdata(client, dev);<br><br>    ret = misc_register(&amp;dev-&gt;miscdev);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (ret) &#123;<br>        dev_err(&amp;client-&gt;dev, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;misc register failed: %d\n&quot;</span>, ret);<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> ret;<br>    &#125;<br><br>    dev_info(&amp;client-&gt;dev, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;/dev/mpu6050_raw created\n&quot;</span>);<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="5-实现字符设备的相关接口函数-fops函数指针簇-以AP3216C为例"><a href="#5-实现字符设备的相关接口函数-fops函数指针簇-以AP3216C为例" class="headerlink" title="5.实现字符设备的相关接口函数(fops函数指针簇, 以AP3216C为例)"></a>5.实现字符设备的相关接口函数(fops函数指针簇, 以AP3216C为例)</h3><p>open,read接口。</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br><span class="line">54</span><br><span class="line">55</span><br><span class="line">56</span><br><span class="line">57</span><br><span class="line">58</span><br><span class="line">59</span><br><span class="line">60</span><br><span class="line">61</span><br><span class="line">62</span><br><span class="line">63</span><br><span class="line">64</span><br><span class="line">65</span><br><span class="line">66</span><br><span class="line">67</span><br><span class="line">68</span><br><span class="line">69</span><br><span class="line">70</span><br><span class="line">71</span><br><span class="line">72</span><br><span class="line">73</span><br><span class="line">74</span><br><span class="line">75</span><br><span class="line">76</span><br><span class="line">77</span><br><span class="line">78</span><br><span class="line">79</span><br><span class="line">80</span><br><span class="line">81</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">static</span> <span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">ap3216c_open</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> inode *inode, <span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> file *file)</span><br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">miscdevice</span> *<span class="hljs-title">miscdev</span> =</span> file-&gt;private_data;<br>    <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">ap3216c_dev</span> *<span class="hljs-title">dev</span>;</span><br><br>    dev = container_of(miscdev, <span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> ap3216c_dev, miscdev);<br>    file-&gt;private_data = dev;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br><span class="hljs-type">static</span> <span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">ap3216c_read_block</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> i2c_client *client, u8 reg, u8 *buf, <span class="hljs-type">int</span> len)</span><br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> ret;<br><br>    ret = i2c_smbus_read_i2c_block_data(client, reg, len, buf);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (ret &lt; <span class="hljs-number">0</span>)<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> ret;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (ret != len)<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> -EIO;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br><span class="hljs-type">static</span> <span class="hljs-type">ssize_t</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">ap3216c_read</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> file *file, <span class="hljs-type">char</span> __user *ubuf, <span class="hljs-type">size_t</span> count, <span class="hljs-type">loff_t</span> *ppos)</span><br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">ap3216c_dev</span> *<span class="hljs-title">dev</span> =</span> file-&gt;private_data;<br>    u8 data[<span class="hljs-number">6</span>];<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> ir, als, ps;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">char</span> kbuf[<span class="hljs-number">256</span>];<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> len;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> ret;<br><br>    mutex_lock(&amp;dev-&gt;lock);<br><br>    <span class="hljs-comment">/*</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">    * Registers:</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">    * 0x0A/0x0B: IR data</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">    * 0x0C/0x0D: ALS data</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">    * 0x0E/0x0F: PS data</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">    */</span><br>    ret = ap3216c_read_block(dev-&gt;client, AP3216C_REG_IR_DATA_LOW,<br>                            data, <span class="hljs-keyword">sizeof</span>(data));<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (ret) &#123;<br>        mutex_unlock(&amp;dev-&gt;lock);<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> ret;<br>    &#125;<br><br>    mutex_unlock(&amp;dev-&gt;lock);<br><br>    <span class="hljs-comment">/*</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">    * AP3216C data format:</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">    * IR:  lower 8 bits in data[0], upper 2 bits in data[1][1:0]</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">    * ALS: 16-bit little-endian</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">    * PS:  lower 4 bits in data[4][3:0], upper 6 bits in data[5][5:0]</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">    */</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (data[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>] &amp; <span class="hljs-number">0x80</span>)<br>        ir = <span class="hljs-number">-1</span>;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span><br>        ir = ((data[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>] &amp; <span class="hljs-number">0x03</span>) &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-number">8</span>) | data[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>];<br><br>    als = (data[<span class="hljs-number">3</span>] &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-number">8</span>) | data[<span class="hljs-number">2</span>];<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (data[<span class="hljs-number">4</span>] &amp; <span class="hljs-number">0x40</span>)<br>        ps = <span class="hljs-number">-1</span>;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span><br>        ps = ((data[<span class="hljs-number">5</span>] &amp; <span class="hljs-number">0x3F</span>) &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-number">4</span>) | (data[<span class="hljs-number">4</span>] &amp; <span class="hljs-number">0x0F</span>);<br><br>    len = scnprintf(kbuf, <span class="hljs-keyword">sizeof</span>(kbuf),<br>                    <span class="hljs-string">&quot;ir_raw: %d\n&quot;</span><br>                    <span class="hljs-string">&quot;als_raw: %d\n&quot;</span><br>                    <span class="hljs-string">&quot;ps_raw: %d\n&quot;</span>,<br>                    ir, als, ps);<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> simple_read_from_buffer(ubuf, count, ppos, kbuf, len);<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-type">static</span> <span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">file_operations</span> <span class="hljs-title">ap3216c_fops</span> =</span> &#123;<br>    .owner = THIS_MODULE,<br>    .open  = ap3216c_open,<br>    .read  = ap3216c_read,<br>&#125;;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="6-编写App并进行相关测试"><a href="#6-编写App并进行相关测试" class="headerlink" title="6.编写App并进行相关测试"></a>6.编写App并进行相关测试</h3><p>编译设备树和相关模块，配置nfs服务，板卡挂载。替换设备树，加载模块，测试App。</p><h2 id="三、总线模型中驱动的匹配方式"><a href="#三、总线模型中驱动的匹配方式" class="headerlink" title="三、总线模型中驱动的匹配方式"></a>三、总线模型中驱动的匹配方式</h2><h3 id="1-设备树匹配"><a href="#1-设备树匹配" class="headerlink" title="1.设备树匹配"></a>1.设备树匹配</h3><p>driver中of_match_table字段下的compatible属性值与设备树节点中的compatible属性值进行匹配。</p><h3 id="2-字符串匹配"><a href="#2-字符串匹配" class="headerlink" title="2.字符串匹配"></a>2.字符串匹配</h3><p>driver中id_table字段下的name属性值与device中的name属性进行匹配。</p><h3 id="3-其他匹配方式-acpi等"><a href="#3-其他匹配方式-acpi等" class="headerlink" title="3.其他匹配方式(acpi等)"></a>3.其他匹配方式(acpi等)</h3><h2 id="四、completion机制"><a href="#四、completion机制" class="headerlink" title="四、completion机制"></a>四、completion机制</h2><h3 id="什么是completion"><a href="#什么是completion" class="headerlink" title="什么是completion?"></a>什么是completion?</h3><blockquote><p>一个执行流需要等待另一个执行流完成某件事。Linux内核为此提供了一种一次性事件同步机制。</p></blockquote><h3 id="核心数据结构和相关api"><a href="#核心数据结构和相关api" class="headerlink" title="核心数据结构和相关api"></a>核心数据结构和相关api</h3><p>核心数据结构</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">completion</span> &#123;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-type">unsigned</span> <span class="hljs-type">int</span> done; ## <span class="hljs-number">0</span> 表示未完成 &gt;<span class="hljs-number">0</span> 表示已完成<br>    <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">swait_queue_head</span> <span class="hljs-title">wait</span>;</span> ## 等待队列头<br>&#125;;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>相关api</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c">DECLARE_COMPLETION(my_completion); ## 静态定义 <br><br><span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">my_dev</span> &#123;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">completion</span> <span class="hljs-title">done</span>;</span><br>&#125;; ## (动态)结构体成员中定义。<br><br>init_completion(&amp;dev-&gt;done); ## 初始化<br><br>wait_for_completion(&amp;dev-&gt;done); ## 等待完成<br>ret = wait_for_completion_timeout(&amp;dev-&gt;done, msecs_to_jiffies(<span class="hljs-number">1000</span>)); ## 超时版本<br><br>complete(&amp;dev-&gt;done); ## 通知完成<br><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="使用方式"><a href="#使用方式" class="headerlink" title="使用方式"></a>使用方式</h3><p>进程上下文： 启动硬件-&gt;睡眠等待 wait_for_completion<br>中断上下文： 硬件完成-&gt;complete() 进程被唤醒，继续检查传输结果 实现异步同步而不是在程序中使用延时这样会造成cpu利用效率偏低</p>]]></content>
    
    
